<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>TOPFEROS MD - Plugins</title>

<style>

body{
background:#0d1117;
font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
color:#fff;
margin:0;
padding:30px;
}

.container{
max-width:1100px;
margin:auto;
}

h1{
color:#00ff88;
margin-bottom:25px;
}

.grid{
display:grid;
grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr));
gap:20px;
}

.card{
background:#161b22;
border-radius:15px;
padding:20px;
box-shadow:0 0 15px rgba(0,255,136,.15);
}

.card h3{
margin-bottom:10px;
color:#00ff88;
}

.card p{
color:#ccc;
font-size:14px;
margin-bottom:15px;
}

button{
width:100%;
padding:12px;
background:#00ff88;
color:#000;
border:none;
border-radius:10px;
font-weight:bold;
cursor:pointer;
}

button:hover{
background:#00dd77;
}

</style>

</head>

<body>

<div class="container">

<h1>🔌 Plugin Manager</h1>

<div class="grid">

<div class="card">
<h3>❤️ Auto React</h3>
<p>Automatically react to incoming messages.</p>
<button>Enable</button>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h3>🤖 AI Chat</h3>
<p>Reply using ChatGPT or Gemini AI.</p>
<button>Enable</button>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h3>📞 Anti Call</h3>
<p>Reject WhatsApp calls automatically.</p>
<button>Enable</button>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h3>📥 Media Downloader</h3>
<p>Download YouTube, TikTok, Facebook and Instagram media.</p>
<button>Enable</button>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h3>👀 Status Saver</h3>
<p>Save viewed WhatsApp Status automatically.</p>
<button>Enable</button>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h3>🛡 Anti Delete</h3>
<p>Recover deleted messages automatically.</p>
<button>Enable</button>
</div>

</div>

</div>

</body>
</html>